  "html": "<article class=\"spell\" data-search=\"流电炽焰 470057 萨满祭司 职业通用 spelleffect\" data-tone=\"mechanic\" id=\"spell-470057\">\n<div class=\"spell-head\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"spell-icon\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://oss.wowdaily.cn/wow_icons_oss/small/inv_10_dungeonjewelry_primalist_trinket_1ragingelement_fire.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"spell-head-main\">\n<div class=\"spell-title-row\"><span class=\"spell-title\">流电炽焰</span><span class=\"spell-id mono\">#470057</span><a class=\"subtle\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/spell=470057\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wowhead</a></div>\n<div class=\"spell-desc\"><span class=\"subtle\">快照参考描述（非本次 Hotfix payload）：</span>立即用炽焰雷霆震击目标及10码内的5个敌人，施加烈焰震击并造成4×SP点自然伤害，且必定爆击。产生6点漩涡值。 <span class=\"del\">已移除：产生1层漩涡武器。</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"impact-block\"><div class=\"impact-block-title\">本次热修来源事实（已核实变化 / 基表对照 / 前态未核实的观察值）</div><div class=\"impact-list\">\n<div class=\"impact-row\"><div><span class=\"impact-label\">字段变化见下方 DB2 明细</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"impact-assessment\"><strong>影响评估</strong><span class=\"tone-badge mechanic\">强弱待评估</span><span class=\"subtle\">判断独立于上方原始字段值；机制参数不直接代表强弱。</span></div>\n</article>",
